        {
          "n": "218",
          "text": "After Gojoson fell, the Korean Peninsula was made into"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "three kingdoms; Goguryo, Baekje and Shilla."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "219",
          "text": "Later these three kingdoms joined as a single nation called the Shilla."
        },
        {
          "n": "220",
          "text": "It was called the golden age of Korean history."
        }
      ]
